   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Extra Audit European Roma Rights Centre</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Extra revision European Roma Rights Centre</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra Sidas uppf&#xf6;ljning av st&#xf6;det till European Roma Rights Centre (ERRC) och f&#xf6;r att s&#xe4;kerst&#xe4;lla att ERRC f&#xf6;ljer avtalet med Sida g&#xf6;rs denna extra ISK revision. Denna revision kan sedan ligga som underlag till en eventuell beredning om nytt st&#xf6;d n&#xe4;r Sidas nuvarande avtal med ERRC l&#xf6;per mot sitt slut 2017.
Beslutsnr: 2014-000886
Contract no: C55191, Sidas ramavtal 2011-000703.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In order to improve Sida&apos;s monitoring of the support to the European Roma Rights Centre (ERRC) and to ensure ERRC&apos;s compliance to the agreement with Sida an extra audit will be commissioned. The audit is also supposed to provide Sida with information to be used should Sida assess further support to ERRC as the current agreement ends 2017.
Decision no.: 2014-000886.
Contract no: C55191, Sida&apos;s framework agrement 2011-000703.</narrative>
  </description>
